-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.2.0 (2025-11-20)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  MAJOR UPDATE: Configuration Management & Extended Multilingual Support

  NEW FEATURES - Configuration Management:
  * Added TUI (Text User Interface) for easy configuration via dialog/whiptail
  * Added GUI (Graphical User Interface) via zenity/yad - works in any DE
  * Added unified CLI interface (sparky-beep-config) with command-line options
  * Implemented comprehensive service discovery system
  * Added tune/melody library management with 10+ built-in melodies
  * Implemented time-based scheduling with quiet hours support
  * Configuration file support: /etc/sparky-beep/beep.conf
  * Automatic configuration backup system for safety
  * Service enable/disable management via TUI/GUI/CLI
  * Custom tune assignment for each service event (start/stop/restart)
  * Schedule rules for time-based beep control
  * Weekday-specific schedule support

  NEW FEATURES - User Interfaces:
  * sparky-beep-config - Auto-detects TUI/GUI based on environment
  * sparky-beep-config --list - List all available services
  * sparky-beep-config --enable <service> - Enable beep for service
  * sparky-beep-config --disable <service> - Disable beep for service
  * sparky-beep-config --test <service> <event> - Test beep sounds
  * Full keyboard navigation in TUI
  * Point-and-click configuration in GUI
  * Preview sounds before applying changes
  * Real-time service status monitoring

  INTERNATIONALIZATION - Expanded from 15 to 26 languages:
  * Added 11 new language translations:
    - Arabic (ar)
    - Catalan (ca)
    - Danish (da)
    - Greek (el)
    - Finnish (fi)
    - Hungarian (hu)
    - Korean (ko)
    - Portuguese Brazil (pt_BR)
    - Romanian (ro)
    - Slovak (sk)
    - Traditional Chinese (zh_TW)
  * Updated all 15 existing languages with 160+ new UI strings
  * Complete Debian i18n language coverage
  * Professional system administration terminology in all languages
  * All TUI/GUI/CLI interfaces fully translated

  NEW LIBRARIES:
  * lib/config.sh - Configuration file management
  * lib/discovery.sh - System service discovery
  * lib/tunes.sh - Tune library management
  * lib/scheduler.sh - Time-based scheduling

  NEW BINARIES:
  * bin/sparky-beep-config - Unified configuration interface
  * bin/sparky-beep-config-tui - Text user interface
  * bin/sparky-beep-config-gui - Graphical user interface

  IMPROVEMENTS:
  * Enhanced install.sh with new components
  * Better user feedback and error messages
  * Cross-desktop environment GUI compatibility
  * Comprehensive multi-language help system
  * Professional translations for all 26 languages
  * Human-readable INI configuration format
  * Service template generation for new beep services

  DOCUMENTATION:
  * Updated LANGUAGES.md for 26 language support
  * Enhanced README.md with configuration management section
  * Updated installation instructions
  * Added configuration examples and usage guides

